{"steam_appid":2294130,"steam_name":"Goobies","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2294130/545976/a6b8616815405a47d99ecd53b344178331168768/1750980846/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1685959449","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256934472/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1685959449","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/ss_d44f520b1c72dd8d26de2e160ffd973345a2cc59.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776855316","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/ss_61391559d55641687eeadde9041d3c1d39b8ccbd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776855316","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/ss_34873a8369a335fa039192c54f76ea27f56a2c9d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776855316","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/ss_371f724fd940053b5ae647e1b9d1e04c4785a993.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776855316","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/ss_85f39449da5004a70c95b0c1d1a3962ff86dfb75.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776855316"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/extras/0a054a2e6bc100dc008e7e575b5fb890.poster.avif?t=1776855316\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/extras/0a054a2e6bc100dc008e7e575b5fb890.webm?t=1776855316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/extras/0a054a2e6bc100dc008e7e575b5fb890.mp4?t=1776855316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Goobies is a top-down auto-shooter game with roguelike elements where you'll battle endless waves of enemies. Take on giant bosses, swarms of smaller blobs, and everything in between. The game offers a wide variety of challenges, with procedurally generated levels and increasing difficulty as you progress. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/extras/1dd491ac5f045904b53a52dadb353e9e.poster.avif?t=1776855316\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/extras/1dd491ac5f045904b53a52dadb353e9e.webm?t=1776855316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/extras/1dd491ac5f045904b53a52dadb353e9e.mp4?t=1776855316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose your champion from a diverse cast of 5 Goobies, each with their own unique passive ability and playstyle. Discover countless combinations of items by collecting over 30 of them, many of which have multiple unique upgrades. Unlock the power of up to 20 game-changing artifacts that will redefine the game's mechanics and visuals. Collect Goobie coins from each run to unlock more power all whilst keeping track of your progress and learning about the lore via the in-game encyclopedia!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/extras/ebcf2a1bb3a3ec3386cd466759623d1a.poster.avif?t=1776855316\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/extras/ebcf2a1bb3a3ec3386cd466759623d1a.webm?t=1776855316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294130/extras/ebcf2a1bb3a3ec3386cd466759623d1a.mp4?t=1776855316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD FX-8320<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 / R9 280<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / R9 390<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","RPG","Strategy"],"developers":["Höganäs Spel"],"publishers":["Höganäs Spel"],"release_date":"14 Jul, 2023"}